  <History Date="18-02-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (hopeless documentation)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="15-08-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Unknown China P1 Evo portman (even worse documentation if that's possible.  translated from Chinese.  photographs of pages from manual provided have different model titles.  the 36 channel mode has 6 elements whereas the 40 channel mode has 7.  this doesn't make any sense.  no pixel layout.  it is pretty much impossible to support this sort of nonsense)" Version="2" />
